  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "iOS APP開發",
    "sub_ename": "DEVELOPMENT OF IOS APP",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之目的在教授學生使用Swift程式語言開發iOS應用程式的技能。課程涵蓋iOS開發環境的設置、基本的程式設計概念、介面設計、資料儲存和API使用等主題。學生將透過實作專案，學習開發iOS應用程式的各個階段，包括設計、開發、測試和部署。課程還強調最佳實踐和使用最新的iOS開發工具和技術，以及與使用者體驗和介面設計相關的重要概念。完成課程後，學生將具備開發iOS應用程式的技能，並能夠創建具有吸引力和功能性的iOS應用程式。",
    "describe_eh": "This course aims to teach students the skills to develop iOS applications using the Swift programming language. The course covers setting up the iOS development environment, basic programming concepts, interface design, data storage, and API usage. Through hands-on projects, students learn the various stages of iOS application development, including design, development, testing, and deployment. The course also emphasizes best practices, the latest iOS development tools and technologies, and essential user experience and interface design concepts. Upon completing the course, students will have the skills to develop iOS applications and create attractive and functional iOS applications.",
